    "intro_narrative": "You have breached the server room of the Helios Corporation, a shadow organization accused of illicit neural experiments. The facility is in lockdown, red emergency lights pulsing against the cold steel of the server racks. Your objective is clear: retrieve the 'Project Chimera' subject list before the halon gas system triggers. The central mainframe is air-gapped and protected by layers of encryption and physical security. You must scavenge the room for credentials, decrypt the fragmented data streams, and piece together the access protocols to query the Master Database Terminal. Time is running out.",
    "narrative_style": "techno_thriller"
  },
